   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Help Me Scrape The Mucas Off My Brain**: back after 283 archived shows (6168 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **I was Nothing**: rare: 11 archived performances [5]\n- **Mr Richard Smoker**: back after 48 archived shows (1370 days) [5]\n- **Push The Little Daisies**: back after 43 archived shows (1050 days) [5]\n- **Sucking The Blood From The Devils Dick**: back after 603 archived shows (9966 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2022-09-15.flac.24** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 156 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer found the recording crisp and full, better than typical live recordings [4]\n- **ween2022-09-15**: audience recording; 0 songs; 159 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2022-09-15.flac.24**: taped by George Hodges, Jr.; transferred by George Hodges, Jr. [1]. Also: Transfer went from SDHC card to PC, Wavelab 6.1, iZotope 7 de-clicking, then FLAC level 8 encoding [1]\n- **ween2022-09-15**: taped by BIGT aka IAMHAMMERED; transferred by BIGT aka IAMHAMMERED; source: AUD [2]. Also: EQ'd and resampled in Adobe Audition 2020, tracked and encoded to FLAC with Audacity 2.3.2 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by jonnyleather.com: [Ween – JONNYLEATHER | Design & Photography](https://jonnyleather.com/portfolio-item/ween/) [6]",
